(7475352, 1187672, 24744, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by smardaz:</b></div><hr/><i> Love the lecture followed by the confession that you also Photoshopped your entry. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>It''s not a "confession", the entire point is that EVEN WITH JUST PHOTOSHOP you can create a lot of other "tilt shift" effects than the brain-dead "fake miniature city" thing. Grow some imagination.</td>', 'Originally posted by smardaz: Love the lecture followed by the confession that you also Photoshopped your entry.  It''s not a "confession", the entire point is that EVEN WITH JUST PHOTOSHOP you can create a lot of other "tilt shift" effects than the brain-dead "fake miniature city" thing. Grow some imagination.', '2016-09-23 02:26:55.000000', NULL, 0),
